     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaRTO-PQ-PQToRatioConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-RTO-PQ-PQ.html\">RTO_PQ_PQ: Ratio (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Ratio\">Ratio</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-RTO-PQ-PQ.html#s-RTO_PQ_PQ.numerator\">RTO_PQ_PQ.numerator</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Ratio#s-Ratio.numerator\">Ratio.numerator</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le numérateur CDA est converti en Quantity à l’aide du mapping PQ vers Quantity, puis affecté à Ratio.numerator.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-RTO-PQ-PQ.html#s-RTO_PQ_PQ.denominator\">RTO_PQ_PQ.denominator</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Ratio#s-Ratio.denominator\">Ratio.denominator</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le dénominateur CDA est converti en Quantity à l’aide du mapping PQ vers Quantity, puis affecté à Ratio.denominator.</td></tr></table></div>"
